  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The powers of your drowic heritage are strong within you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Drow Nobility<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to your caster level for your racial spell-like abilities, and for abilities usable once per day you can use them more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each additional use.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc112\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
